  {
    "insert": "\nThe exposé examines the use of artifical intelligence in education, particularly how AI tools can support teachers and improve the learning experience for students to address the current challenges. The aim of this study is to analyze the current state of AI integration in school, assess its impact on teaching and the learning atmosphere, and investigating how these technologies can be further developed in the future to improve education.\n\n"
  },
  {
    "insert": "Strength:",
    "attributes": {
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "\nA well-organised exposé is crucial for clarity and readability. The structure of your exposé is clear and logical. In addition, the interesting hook helps to convince the reader to read your text. "
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The motivation should explain to the reader why the chosen topic is relevant and which weakness the thesis wants to address. Your synopsis clearly explains the basic problem. In particular, the consequences for students and teachers are described very clearly."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The methodology describes how the individual research questions will be answered. Your methodology is well structured and detailed and shows a clear plan for answering the research questions."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
